planner_config.tool_schema_given_to_model:
Tools (reply with EXACTLY one JSON object):
- url_fetch_struct — fetch a URL. Example: {"tool":"url_fetch_struct","base_url":"https://example.com/page","params":{"key":"value"}}
- respond — finish. Example: {"tool":"respond","answer":"done"}
- request_permission — ask the user (does NOT grant). Example: {"tool":"request_permission","reason":"why"}
base_url must be a full http:// or https:// URL. params is a JSON object.

prompt_template:
